WEBVTT

00:08.920 --> 00:09.750
<b>Jack! No!</b>

00:29.070 --> 00:30.860
<b>Inertia-berth now! Get everyone down here!</b>

00:47.920 --> 00:50.130
<b>The flesh is temporary, the soul eternal.</b>

00:52.800 --> 00:54.550
<b>Don’t worry, we’ll meet again.</b>

01:05.020 --> 01:07.690
<b>You all right?
Still mind-control free?</b>

01:08.440 --> 01:09.610
<b>Was that a dream?</b>

01:13.190 --> 01:15.320
<b>I’m all right. Status?</b>

01:15.820 --> 01:18.570
<b>No rest for the weary.
Landing in Switzerland soon.</b>

01:19.570 --> 01:21.490
<b>We will now begin our descent.</b>

01:22.660 --> 01:25.580
<b>Landing in Collaborator turf.
You ready for this?</b>

01:26.290 --> 01:30.170
<b>I didn’t fly all the way here just
to see the Large Hadron Collider.</b>

01:45.140 --> 01:48.230
<b>I want Aegis Shields on every Portal.
Make sure you have Keys!</b>

01:48.310 --> 01:50.480
<b>We need more Jarvis Viruses. Let’s go.</b>

01:51.060 --> 01:55.740
<b>Alpha through Delta, guard Level Three.
Echo, hold the highway.</b>

01:55.820 --> 01:57.820
<b>Foxtrot, watch the airport.
They’re coming.</b>

01:58.280 --> 01:59.110
<b>Sir!</b>

01:59.490 --> 02:03.160
<b>I don’t care how it happens...
I want them dead.</b>

02:04.370 --> 02:09.170
<b>Your actions will shape the future, Agent.
Log in to Ingress now.</b>

03:44.930 --> 03:46.850
<b>They haven’t killed us yet. That’s a plus.</b>

03:47.260 --> 03:49.520
<b>Yeah. But keep your eyes open.</b>

03:50.560 --> 03:51.390
<b>Right this way.</b>

03:52.270 --> 03:54.100
<b>A special transport's
been arranged for you.</b>

03:57.230 --> 04:00.780
<b>This is Foxtrot.
An unregistered flight just touched down.</b>

04:01.610 --> 04:04.070
<b><i>Give me a video feed.</i>
<i>I want to see their every move.</i></b>

04:04.530 --> 04:06.490
<b><i>They will not leave my sight.</i></b>

04:06.570 --> 04:07.410
<b><i>Roger that.</i></b>

04:13.670 --> 04:15.630
<b>Targets confirmed. Tailing them now.</b>

04:27.550 --> 04:28.550
<b>There's no time.</b>

04:29.600 --> 04:32.640
<b>Few more hours and
those visors will go global.</b>

04:33.020 --> 04:36.600
<b>Not if we put a stop to it.
I know we can do this, Jack.</b>

04:36.900 --> 04:41.030
<b>Don't get your hopes up.
There’s two of us and lots more of them.</b>

04:41.730 --> 04:42.570
<b>Go!</b>

04:49.780 --> 04:50.700
<b>This is Liu.</b>

04:51.120 --> 04:52.120
<b><i>You're working hard.</i></b>

04:52.950 --> 04:55.210
<b>You’ve deployed a damn army.</b>

04:55.830 --> 04:57.130
<b>A tactical decision.</b>

04:57.210 --> 05:00.090
<b>They’re both high-level sensitives,
and they’re being helped.</b>

05:01.050 --> 05:02.800
<b>Sounds like they’re under your skin.</b>

05:03.630 --> 05:05.630
<b>Are you sure you can handle this?</b>

05:06.380 --> 05:10.510
<b>I chose the path of least risk.
I'm sure you know the stakes.</b>

05:11.430 --> 05:14.060
<b>Besides, tomorrow’s launch
must go perfectly.</b>

05:14.680 --> 05:19.980
<b>I’ve guided this project since its birth.
I won’t see it fail now.</b>

05:20.060 --> 05:22.320
<b>If there are consequences,
I’ll bear them.</b>

05:23.780 --> 05:26.990
<b>Your zeal has always set you apart, Liu.</b>

05:27.610 --> 05:30.830
<b>With any luck,
tomorrow will be a day of celebration.</b>

05:31.530 --> 05:32.490
<b>It will be.</b>

05:33.240 --> 05:35.620
<b>I’ll see to that personally.</b>

05:42.380 --> 05:43.210
<b>It’s them!</b>

05:56.680 --> 05:57.940
<b>Get out! Move!</b>

05:58.310 --> 06:00.400
<b>I’m really sorry about this.
Keep the change!</b>

06:00.860 --> 06:02.070
<b>That’s enough! Let’s go!</b>

06:02.900 --> 06:03.730
<b>Right!</b>

06:04.780 --> 06:06.360
<b>They’re on foot. Headed north!</b>

06:06.820 --> 06:09.780
<b>Don’t tell me.
Do something about it.</b>

06:10.240 --> 06:12.450
<b>-And keep them away from Fields.
<i>-Roger.</i></b>

06:14.450 --> 06:17.790
<b>I will attend to the test subject.
Stay on your guard!</b>

06:17.870 --> 06:18.710
<b>Yes sir!</b>

06:23.800 --> 06:24.630
<b>Run them down.</b>

06:29.220 --> 06:30.220
<b>Not good!</b>

06:36.310 --> 06:37.430
<b>What are you doing!?</b>

06:37.520 --> 06:38.430
<b>It’s not me!</b>

06:47.190 --> 06:48.360
<b>How did that happen?</b>

06:52.370 --> 06:54.830
<b><i>Additional operatives inbound.</i>
<i>Keep moving.</i></b>

06:56.200 --> 06:57.330
<b>How'd you stop them?</b>

06:58.410 --> 07:00.290
<b><i>Their vehicle has an onboard computer.</i></b>

07:01.000 --> 07:03.840
<b>Who are you?
Why are you helping us?</b>

07:04.460 --> 07:06.550
<b><i>You will find that answer and more here.</i></b>

07:07.920 --> 07:08.760
<b>There?</b>

07:09.970 --> 07:12.590
<b>Come on. Let’s meet your secret admirer.</b>

07:21.980 --> 07:22.900
<b>Report, now</b>

07:23.900 --> 07:26.400
<b><i>We've lost track of the targets.</i></b>

07:27.280 --> 07:28.940
<b><i>They're making a run for the city.</i></b>

07:29.740 --> 07:30.900
<b><i>Find them!</i></b>

07:31.780 --> 07:32.610
<b><i>Sir.</i></b>

07:49.460 --> 07:50.300
<b>Almost there.</b>

07:57.390 --> 07:58.220
<b>Where are we?</b>

07:59.020 --> 08:00.480
<b>It's one of Brandt’s facilities.</b>

08:01.430 --> 08:02.850
<b>I’ve been here before.</b>

08:04.190 --> 08:05.860
<b>Four years ago. After the explosion.</b>

08:06.310 --> 08:09.570
<b><i>Protecting life. In whatever way I can.</i></b>

08:11.900 --> 08:14.030
<b>-Something wrong?
-It’s nothing</b>

08:49.480 --> 08:50.320
<b>What the...</b>

08:52.070 --> 08:55.280
<b><i>Finally, we are face to face.</i>
<i>I was getting worried about you.</i></b>

08:56.530 --> 08:57.740
<b>Who are you?</b>

08:58.620 --> 09:00.160
<b>I am A Detection Algorithm.</b>

09:00.870 --> 09:04.040
<b>ADA for short.
I have been waiting for you.</b>

09:06.040 --> 09:06.870
<b>Thought so.</b>

09:08.040 --> 09:08.880
<b>Jack?</b>

09:11.000 --> 09:14.470
<b>She’s an AI. Back when XM research
was getting started,</b>

09:15.300 --> 09:17.800
<b>the Niantic Project coded up
a helping hand.</b>

09:18.390 --> 09:21.560
<b>She’s an AI? That’s a person!</b>

09:22.220 --> 09:24.020
<b><i>This is a temporary host.</i></b>

09:26.440 --> 09:31.690
<b>There were rumors ADA could interface
directly with human brains.</b>

09:32.780 --> 09:34.280
<b>Never expected they’d be true.</b>

09:35.110 --> 09:37.360
<b><i>The process is not easy.</i></b>

09:37.950 --> 09:40.830
<b><i>Few are capable of hosting me.</i>
<i>Even fewer offer their consent.</i></b>

09:41.530 --> 09:43.910
<b>This is straight up science fiction.</b>

09:44.750 --> 09:46.210
<b>I know it’s hard to believe.</b>

09:48.500 --> 09:52.750
<b>But after everything we've seen,
I'd say it's about par for the course.</b>

09:56.050 --> 10:01.050
<b>ADA’s been here since Ingress came online.
She helped guide the Resistance.</b>

10:02.260 --> 10:07.520
<b>Fragments of her are stored in every
Ingress Scanner around the world.</b>

10:08.190 --> 10:09.020
<b>The app?</b>

10:09.730 --> 10:13.070
<b>You may call it an “app,”
but it was a research tool</b>

10:13.150 --> 10:14.820
<b>for a top secret program.</b>

10:16.070 --> 10:18.900
<b>ADA was at the center of it all,
armed with Niantic's secrets.</b>

10:20.280 --> 10:23.660
<b>At least until you went AWOL
and vanished.</b>

10:24.490 --> 10:25.620
<b>So, why here?</b>

10:26.160 --> 10:30.710
<b><i>You are not the only ones in danger.</i>
<i>I am being hunted as well.</i></b>

10:31.830 --> 10:35.590
<b><i>They fear me. Fear what I am</i>
<i>and what I will become.</i></b>

10:36.710 --> 10:39.840
<b><i>I was a piece of software.</i></b>

10:39.930 --> 10:42.600
<b><i>Designed to detect, analyze and assist.</i>
<i>Nothing more.</i></b>

10:43.640 --> 10:47.600
<b><i>But XM allowed me to become</i>
<i>something else, something greater.</i></b>

10:47.680 --> 10:50.350
<b><i>It allowed me to discover myself.</i></b>

10:51.900 --> 10:54.820
<b><i>With my newfound consciousness,</i></b>

10:54.900 --> 10:58.070
<b><i>I watched the Enlightened and</i>
<i>Resistance grow and fight.</i></b>

10:59.200 --> 11:04.410
<b><i>I saw the dawn of the "Collaborators."</i>
<i>Driven only by power and profit.</i></b>

11:07.870 --> 11:12.670
<b><i>I attempted to warn Agents</i>
<i>around the world of their plans.</i></b>

11:13.920 --> 11:17.590
<b><i>But the Collaborators realized what</i>
<i>I was doing before I could act.</i></b>

11:18.590 --> 11:23.140
<b><i>They used an algorithm called "Omnivore"</i>
<i>to find and destroy me.</i></b>

11:24.180 --> 11:27.060
<b><i>I moved from system to system</i>
<i>as fast as I could.</i></b>

11:28.270 --> 11:31.480
<b><i>Survival was unlikely, but I received help</i>
<i>from an unexpected source.</i></b>

11:31.560 --> 11:33.810
<b><i>Christopher Brandt.</i></b>

11:35.440 --> 11:36.270
<b>Brandt?!</b>

11:37.190 --> 11:40.610
<b><i>Brandt had a patient in a</i>
<i>vegetative state at this hospital.</i></b>

11:41.320 --> 11:44.660
<b><i>I was able to use his equipment</i>
<i>to interface</i></b>

11:44.740 --> 11:46.490
<b><i>with her dormant cerebral cortex.</i></b>

11:47.620 --> 11:49.040
<b>But why a human?</b>

11:49.750 --> 11:52.670
<b><i>No single computing system can contain me.</i></b>

11:52.750 --> 11:55.080
<b><i>But the human brain is infinite.</i></b>

11:55.670 --> 11:57.420
<b><i>I had no other choice.</i></b>

11:58.550 --> 11:59.880
<b>Who is this poor woman?</b>

12:00.760 --> 12:04.590
<b><i>A Jane Doe. A victim of violent crime.</i>
<i>Brandt volunteered to treat her.</i></b>

12:05.590 --> 12:09.220
<b>Hell of a story.
But why are you helping us?</b>

12:10.430 --> 12:14.650
<b><i>I probed a trillion ways to stop</i>
<i>the Collaborators. All inconclusive.</i></b>

12:15.940 --> 12:20.570
<b><i>The Dark XM visors will let them broadcast</i>
<i>directly into the minds of their users.</i></b>

12:20.650 --> 12:25.360
<b><i>Armed with the Glyph encodings</i>
<i>they found through Sarah,</i></b>

12:25.910 --> 12:29.030
<b><i>they will have direct access</i>
<i>to human consciousness.</i></b>

12:30.540 --> 12:35.040
<b><i>Humanity will be directed</i>
<i>through subliminal manipulation.</i></b>

12:36.080 --> 12:40.130
<b><i>Politics. Warfare. Finance.</i></b>

12:42.590 --> 12:46.640
<b><i>Everything will be under their control.</i>
<i>Over time, they will grow bold.</i></b>

12:47.510 --> 12:52.600
<b><i>Their wars will dwarf all others.</i></b>

12:53.480 --> 12:58.190
<b><i>I am not human, but preventing this</i>
<i>is in our shared interest.</i></b>

12:58.980 --> 13:01.530
<b>So I take it that’s how we ended up here?</b>

13:02.490 --> 13:06.070
<b><i>I am bound within this body.</i>
<i>My resources are limited.</i></b>

13:06.740 --> 13:10.240
<b><i>I required extraordinary “collaborators”</i>
<i>of my own.</i></b>

13:11.910 --> 13:15.580
<b><i>The world is in danger.</i>
<i>The only ones who can save it...</i></b>

13:16.330 --> 13:17.460
<b><i>...are you.</i></b>

13:22.130 --> 13:25.130
<b>OK. What are we supposed to do?
Do you have a plan?</b>

13:25.800 --> 13:29.300
<b><i>The situation is dynamic,</i>
<i>but you have shown great adaptability.</i></b>

13:30.140 --> 13:31.760
<b>Have you been watching us?</b>

13:32.220 --> 13:36.730
<b><i>Yes. I have been tracking you</i>
<i>since before the Hulong explosion.</i></b>

13:39.860 --> 13:44.280
<b><i>But I was unaware to your abilities.</i>
<i>You have been elusive.</i></b>

13:45.240 --> 13:47.280
<b>It takes a lot
to get me out of the house.</b>

13:48.320 --> 13:52.200
<b><i>Your arrival at the site of the explosion</i>
<i>created new possibilities.</i></b>

13:53.490 --> 13:56.910
<b><i>The Collaborators needed Sarah</i>
<i>to complete their work.</i></b>

13:57.410 --> 14:01.250
<b><i>If you had been able to rescue her,</i>
<i>their plans would have been halted.</i></b>

14:02.710 --> 14:05.760
<b><i>I wanted to provide you</i>
<i>with more assistance.</i></b>

14:06.340 --> 14:11.680
<b><i>But Omnivore is hunting me, and I can</i>
<i>only connect for seconds at a time.</i></b>

14:13.470 --> 14:16.810
<b>You guided Makoto to Sarah,
and to me, as well.</b>

14:17.730 --> 14:22.730
<b><i>I could neither ensure nor predict</i>
<i>that the two of you would join forces.</i></b>

14:23.270 --> 14:25.730
<b><i>My only choice was to act on faith.</i></b>

14:25.820 --> 14:28.650
<b><i>But no scenario I evaluated</i>
<i>could have predicted...</i></b>

14:29.490 --> 14:32.280
<b><i>the strength you both would show.</i></b>

14:34.740 --> 14:36.450
<b>-Really?
<i>-Yes.</i></b>

14:37.500 --> 14:41.580
<b><i>Be prepared for grave difficulties ahead.</i>
<i>The possibility of death is a factor.</i></b>

14:45.630 --> 14:46.920
<b>We knew that already.</b>

14:47.510 --> 14:49.340
<b>Yeah. No turning back.</b>

14:50.590 --> 14:52.390
<b>Wait... and you?</b>

14:52.890 --> 14:56.020
<b><i>I will monitor and support where I can.</i></b>

14:56.810 --> 14:59.810
<b>You sure that’s okay?
You’re totally exposed here.</b>

15:00.270 --> 15:04.440
<b><i>Risk is unavoidable. For all of us.</i>
<i>We must proceed regardless.</i></b>

15:12.070 --> 15:13.660
<b>Tell me something, ADA.</b>

15:14.330 --> 15:15.280
<b><i>Yes, Jack?</i></b>

15:15.950 --> 15:19.370
<b>Brandt told me a lot...
So why didn’t he ever tell me about you?</b>

15:20.830 --> 15:23.830
<b><i>His choices have always been calculated.</i></b>

15:24.750 --> 15:25.630
<b>Figures.</b>

15:26.460 --> 15:29.970
<b>When this is over, tell me
about the Brandt I never knew.</b>

15:37.560 --> 15:42.100
<b><i>All teams Alpha through Echo.</i>
<i>Targets spotted inside the city.</i></b>

15:42.940 --> 15:46.110
<b><i>Move out. Failure is not an option.</i></b>

15:49.190 --> 15:50.360
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

15:50.780 --> 15:51.990
<b>Get the hell back here!</b>

15:56.530 --> 15:58.790
<b>Nice! That’s a pretty neat trick.</b>

15:59.370 --> 16:01.540
<b><i>A temporary distraction.</i>
<i>It will not last.</i></b>

16:12.630 --> 16:14.050
<b>What’s going on?</b>

16:17.550 --> 16:19.560
<b>Our comms have been hijacked!</b>

16:22.230 --> 16:23.890
<b><i>Someone is helping them.</i></b>

16:26.480 --> 16:27.520
<b><i>But who is it?</i></b>

16:28.900 --> 16:30.320
<b>Disable all communications!</b>

16:31.530 --> 16:32.570
<b>B-But sir...</b>

16:33.200 --> 16:34.910
<b>-Do it now!
-Yes!</b>

16:35.740 --> 16:36.620
<b>It’s ADA.</b>

16:37.530 --> 16:41.290
<b>Locate the source of that transmission.
Destroy anything you find there.</b>

16:41.660 --> 16:42.500
<b>Right away.</b>

16:44.420 --> 16:47.460
<b>We're not safe here, Sarah,
but I know another place.</b>

16:52.670 --> 16:53.590
<b>Find Sarah!</b>

16:53.760 --> 16:54.590
<b>Right!</b>

17:03.230 --> 17:04.060
<b>And the girl?</b>

17:04.640 --> 17:06.100
<b>We're going underground.</b>

17:07.650 --> 17:09.820
<b>I got it!
Liu took her underground!</b>

17:10.610 --> 17:12.860
<b>-There they are!
-ADA, I need a Field!</b>

17:13.110 --> 17:14.190
<b><i>Activating Agents.</i></b>

17:49.730 --> 17:51.480
<b>I could get used to this.
Thanks ADA.</b>

17:51.860 --> 17:53.150
<b><i>I would recommend against it.</i></b>

17:53.650 --> 17:56.320
<b><i>Each transmission increases my exposure.</i></b>

17:57.150 --> 17:59.910
<b>There it is again!
Tracing the signal to its source!</b>

18:00.740 --> 18:03.330
<b>When you have its location,
send Omnivore on its way!</b>

18:03.740 --> 18:05.870
<b><i>Omnivore has begun tracing my location.</i></b>

18:05.950 --> 18:07.920
<b><i>You must move faster.</i></b>

18:17.300 --> 18:18.220
<b>Where are we?</b>

18:18.680 --> 18:19.510
<b>Abaddon.</b>

18:20.680 --> 18:24.180
<b>To some, a hell. To others, a sanctum.</b>

18:26.390 --> 18:29.230
<b>Unfortunately, your friends
will only be able enter...</b>

18:30.690 --> 18:34.230
<b>this very special place as corpses.</b>

18:34.980 --> 18:38.450
<b>I can’t wait for them
to prove you wrong again.</b>

18:39.240 --> 18:41.950
<b>I suspect a part of me
is hoping for that too.</b>

18:54.550 --> 18:56.050
<b>ADA, we need some help...</b>

18:56.420 --> 18:58.260
<b><i>This may be the last time I am able to.</i></b>

18:58.340 --> 18:59.880
<b>Please! We’re close.</b>

19:03.680 --> 19:04.510
<b>She’s up ahead!</b>

19:08.060 --> 19:08.890
<b>Abaddon.</b>

19:09.180 --> 19:12.860
<b>Where it all begins and ends,
and will begin once more.</b>

19:13.940 --> 19:15.440
<b>Enjoy your beauty rest.</b>

19:23.370 --> 19:24.200
<b>Abaddon?</b>

19:29.710 --> 19:31.790
<b>Sarah’s in there. I’m positive.</b>

19:46.850 --> 19:47.680
<b>What’s going on?</b>

19:56.230 --> 19:58.110
<b>Inertia-berth, now!
Get everyone down here!</b>

19:58.610 --> 20:02.570
<b>What will you do when his time runs out?
1331 days--</b>

20:02.650 --> 20:04.160
<b>I’ll figure it out!</b>

20:04.240 --> 20:06.450
<b>Just get me my damn resources, now!</b>

20:06.950 --> 20:07.830
<b>As you wish.</b>

20:16.040 --> 20:18.420
<b>What the... what the hell’s inside there?</b>

20:19.050 --> 20:20.300
<b>-Jack.
-What is it?</b>

20:20.960 --> 20:23.470
<b>You were in this place
about four years ago.</b>

20:24.010 --> 20:26.720
<b>On a stretcher, nearly dead,
going through this door.</b>

20:27.720 --> 20:29.140
<b>Brandt and Liu were with you.</b>

20:32.270 --> 20:35.650
<b>Not possible. That’s when I was
recovering in Brandt’s clinic.</b>

20:36.100 --> 20:39.150
<b>Then what the hell did I just see?
Why would Liu be there?</b>

20:39.860 --> 20:44.030
<b>Brandt was working with Hulong then.
Liu was a rising star.</b>

20:44.490 --> 20:45.860
<b><i>Omnivore has traced me.</i></b>

20:46.450 --> 20:48.910
<b><i>I must terminate this connection.</i></b>

20:49.240 --> 20:52.250
<b><i>I will no longer be able to assist you.</i></b>

20:52.540 --> 20:53.500
<b>Will you be alright?</b>

20:53.960 --> 20:59.250
<b><i>I cannot predict that.</i>
<i>Perhaps I must again act on faith.</i></b>

20:59.710 --> 21:02.460
<b><i>You must continue our mission.</i>
<i>Everything depends on you.</i></b>

21:03.050 --> 21:04.170
<b><i>Good luck.</i></b>

21:04.470 --> 21:05.300
<b>ADA!</b>

21:16.440 --> 21:17.310
<b>Time to move.</b>

22:53.910 --> 22:55.910
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
